                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-title">Cabeçalhos HTTP de segurança</div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-desc">CSP com nonces, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy e Permissions-Policy em toda resposta.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="sec-feat">
                            <div class="sec-feat-ico" aria-hidden="true" style="background:rgba(212,168,71,0.10);color:var(--c-gold);">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
                                    <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                                    <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
                                    <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-title">Audit logs estruturados</div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-desc">Toda ação crítica registrada com timestamp, usuário, empresa e correlation ID.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="sec-feat">
                            <div class="sec-feat-ico" aria-hidden="true" style="background:rgba(167,139,250,0.10);color:var(--c-purple);">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                                    <line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-title">Rate limiting no login</div>
                                <div class="sec-feat-desc">Proteção contra força bruta por IP e e-mail, com lockout temporário progressivo.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="sec-mosaic reveal delay-2">
                    <div class="sec-tile">
